pide pour se mettre en travers de votre chemin. \n\nEt vous ? Vous \u00eates un h\u00e9ros parfaitement moyen (ou disons\u2026 un aventurier ?) qui essaie de sauver la mise. Ou de tout g\u00e2cher. C\u2019est vous qui voyez. ", "short_description": "TaVRn\u2019s Takedown, c\u2019est un beat 'em up en VR dans l\u2019univers barr\u00e9 du Donjon de Naheulbeuk, d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 par VR Studio LDLC. Colle des baffes, d\u00e9truis le mobilier des tavernes pour sauver Mliuej\u2026 ou transforme la ville en immense chaos !\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "3183306665203162", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823876_3183306668536495_1618518139851191842_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GL9h-qvAew0Q7kNvwGrulc1&_nc_oc=AdoyhI9vo8OYMIhXuDjcrXJdw74FchxCLX_aOrLCaLdFfdjvw9kwd8P2Aor2hkL9XHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1fxlQuelI9lYdNeNljFwSu0Yxo0_wBIywaBrKOV9rk2Q&oe=69F0A905"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare copie.png", "id": "1880433679219419", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1880433682552752_1980421045084427771_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nd13aEn5pxgQ7kNvwH65Sl9&_nc_oc=Adrwwaz2JQyNhxFcQt2qSFchg9X1Qby5XFzoIjDxg6pIR9sYZT6rszdS1_YAOsksgyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1eH-Ri01T-55xX72-72O7K18id0BkLxVttTBpgHTmteA&oe=69F0D00E"}, {"file_name": "NHBK_Logo_H1440.png", "id": "1660891154542652", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819944_1660891157875985_4872676651041472123_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=et9W_lsRl-4Q7kNvwFm-T5l&_nc_oc=AdorSD9TUF5n4z9GDDGAJZ6EkfjLwqNTanzNI-a8Gu91Mer30Mydsrz0UqxJe9i0hBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2Zt6NWfFaMqxCzDmVrPohFLWzUAK4vtO7PZoJYCk27QQ&oe=69F0A8DC"}, {"file_